<section id="一cmake-是什么" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="一cmake-是什么">一、CMake 是什么</h2>
<p>CMake 是一个跨平台的构建工具，通过 <code>CMakeLists.txt</code> 描述工程结构，自动生成 Makefile 或 Visual Studio 工程文件，从而实现“一次编写，处处编译”。</p>
</section>
<section id="二最小工程示例" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="二最小工程示例">二、最小工程示例</h2>
<p>新建一个目录，目录内放置两个文件：</p>
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode" id="cb1" style="background: #f1f3f5;"><pre class="sourceCode cmake code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode cmake"><span id="cb1-1"><span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># CMakeLists.txt</span></span>
<span id="cb1-2"><span class="kw" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-weight: bold;
font-style: inherit;">cmake_minimum_required</span>(<span class="ot" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">VERSION</span> <span class="dt" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">3.16</span>)</span>
<span id="cb1-3"><span class="kw" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-weight: bold;
font-style: inherit;">project</span>(hello <span class="ot" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">LANGUAGES</span> <span class="ot" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">CXX</span>)</span>
<span id="cb1-4"></span>
<span id="cb1-5"><span class="kw" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-weight: bold;
font-style: inherit;">set</span>(<span class="dv" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">CMAKE_CXX_STANDARD</span> 17)</span>
<span id="cb1-6"><span class="kw" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-weight: bold;
font-style: inherit;">add_executable</span>(<span class="bn" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">hello</span> main.cpp)</span></code></pre></div></div>
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode" id="cb2" style="background: #f1f3f5;"><pre class="sourceCode cpp code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode cpp"><span id="cb2-1"><span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">// main.cpp</span></span>
<span id="cb2-2"><span class="pp" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">#include </span><span class="im" style="color: #00769E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">&lt;iostream&gt;</span></span>
<span id="cb2-3"></span>
<span id="cb2-4"><span class="dt" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">int</span> main<span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">()</span> <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">{</span></span>
<span id="cb2-5">    <span class="bu" style="color: null;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">std::</span>cout <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"Hello, CMake!"</span> <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class="bu" style="color: null;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">std::</span>endl<span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">;</span></span>
<span id="cb2-6">    <span class="cf" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-weight: bold;
font-style: inherit;">return</span> <span class="dv" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">0</span><span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">;</span></span>
<span id="cb2-7"><span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">}</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>然后在命令行执行：</p>
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode" id="cb3" style="background: #f1f3f5;"><pre class="sourceCode bash code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode bash"><span id="cb3-1"><span class="fu" style="color: #4758AB;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">mkdir</span> build <span class="kw" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-weight: bold;
font-style: inherit;">&amp;&amp;</span> <span class="bu" style="color: null;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">cd</span> build</span>
<span id="cb3-2"><span class="fu" style="color: #4758AB;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">cmake</span> ..</span>
<span id="cb3-3"><span class="fu" style="color: #4758AB;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">cmake</span> <span class="at" style="color: #657422;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">--build</span> .</span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>即可在 <code>build/</code> 目录下得到可执行文件 <code>hello</code>。</p>
</section>
<section id="三常用命令速查" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="三常用命令速查">三、常用命令速查</h2>
<table class="caption-top table">
<thead>
<tr class="header">
<th>命令</th>
<th>作用</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr class="odd">
<td><code>cmake_minimum_required</code></td>
<td>声明最低 CMake 版本</td>
</tr>
<tr class="even">
<td><code>project</code></td>
<td>定义工程名与使用的语言</td>
</tr>
<tr class="odd">
<td><code>add_executable</code></td>
<td>生成可执行文件</td>
</tr>
<tr class="even">
<td><code>add_library</code></td>
<td>生成库文件（静态/动态）</td>
</tr>
<tr class="odd">
<td><code>target_link_libraries</code></td>
<td>链接依赖库</td>
</tr>
<tr class="even">
<td><code>target_include_directories</code></td>
<td>指定头文件搜索路径</td>
</tr>
<tr class="odd">
<td><code>find_package</code></td>
<td>查找第三方库（如 Qt、CUDA）</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</section>
<section id="四小结" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="四小结">四、小结</h2>
<p>使用外部构建目录（<code>build/</code>）可以保持源码目录整洁；现代 CMake 推荐以 target 为中心组织依赖，而不是全局设置变量。</p>
<p>完整文章发布于 CSDN：<a href="https://blog.csdn.net/xingghaoyuxitong/article/details/157946816">点击阅读原文</a></p>


</section>

